  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Stainless steel case with a black rubber strap. Uni-directional rotating stainless steel bezel with an inlaid black ceramic ring. Graded grey dial with luminous gold-tone hands and dot hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Luminescent hands and markers. Date display above the 6 o'clock position. Powermatic 80.111 automatic movement, containing 23 Jewels, bitting at 28800 vph, and has a power reserve of approximately 80 hours. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Screw down crown. Transparent case back. Round case shape. Case size: 46 mm. Case thickness: 16.3 mm. Band width: 22 mm. Tang clasp. Water resistant at 600 meters / 2000 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second. Seastar 2000 Series. Dive watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot Seastar 2000 Automatic Graded Grey Dial Men's Watch T120.607.17.441.01.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Seastar 2000</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T120.607.17.441.01</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bo